Dead
----
Proof, for each: the original's own record says nothing reaches it (its
source comment: "nothing reaches", "Nothing calls it", "Reached only by
unit_...", a lone RTS after a jump, or debug code no build calls), or no call
to it in src/ from live code and no JSR, JMP, JSL or JML to its address in
the ROM (assets/cart.dat; the count is given). Debug panels, prints and
halts: debug code the shipped game never calls.
